! STEOM-DLPNO-CCSD def2-TZVP def2-TZVP/C def2/J RIJCOSX TightSCF TightPNO
# 73-atom production model: chr + His148 + full Tyr203, def2-TZVP.
# Convergence recipe validated on the 44-atom SVP run (-> 500.9 nm, clean STEOM).
# 8 ranks + conservative maxcore: TZVP/73-atom is memory-heavy (62 GB box), watchdog armed.
%maxcore 4000
%pal nprocs 8 end
%pointcharges "field_big.pc"
%mdci
  NRoots 5
  DoRootWise true
  DoStoreSTEOM true
  AddL2Term True
  TCutPNOSingles 1e-12
  NDav 400
  MaxIter 200
end
* xyzfile -1 1 geom_big.xyz
